# Fixed defect 577, 2026-10-10 (panel 206 R1; the critic's `c18`): a step over
# a constant another module writes, `limits.TOP + 100` in a `u8`, is refused
# where it is written, the other module's body walked first as this one's
# own constants are. The value is the other module's, so `limits.TOP` read as
# 200 makes the sum 300.

use fixedbugs577/limits

constant ABOVE: u8
    limits.TOP + 100  #~ int_out_of_range

function main()
    print(ABOVE)
